WEBVTT

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.980
<i>The students of the Misfit Class 
were given a task.</i>

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:16.620
<i>If they do not all advance to the 
Dalet rank before their second year,</i>

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:22.290
<i>they will be kicked out of the Royal One, 
which they worked so hard to acquire.</i>

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:26.330
<i>Iruma and his friends must attempt 
the rank-advancement exams.</i>

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>First up... The Harvest Festival!</i>

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:07.520
<b>Lead's Distress</b>

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.600
"Lead's Distress."

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:14.020
Bow.

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:18.020
I'm everyone's sweetheart, Dosanko.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:22.160
<b>Let's review 
what's happened</b>

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:21.120
Let's review what's happened.

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:26.860
In a certain place in Block 2 
of the Harvest Festival

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:29.200
stood a lovely castle.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:34.050
There lived an exquisitely beautiful 
young man, the beautiful Dosanko,

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:36.840
and some randos.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:41.270
But one day, Dosanko realized something...

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:44.770
When the beautiful young man

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:49.920
was together with his comrade Goemon...

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:51.640
I'm overflowing with emotions!

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:54.480
And I can't get enough Hell Gray tea!

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:57.200
Dosa-chan, you call that a review?

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.980
That just won't do.

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:01.630
We're finally on day three 
of the Harvest Festival.

00:02:59.030 --> 00:02:59.570
<b>Day 1</b>

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:00.110
<b>Day 2</b>

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:02.240
<b>Day 3</b>

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:04.820
So much has happened!

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:05.780
I will be the one who wins!

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:05.780
Yup, yup!

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:07.710
Head over heels!

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:09.830
I love you the most.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.240
Don't do it.

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:13.030
I'll be back.

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:14.510
Knock...

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.820
I shall give you the Seed of Beginnings.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.000
Thank you very much!

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:24.300
I'm lonely!

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:26.050
<i>Pierce through!</i>

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:29.920
Iruma has come back alive!

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:32.480
The Vase of Endings!

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.940
<b>Vase of Endings</b>

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:38.120
Let's do our best to win, too!

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:42.280
Endymion-sama!

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:54.880
<b>Block 2</b>

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:48.430
<i>And after a grand adventure, 
Lead was able to get the Vase of Endings...</i>

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:56.610
Hey, Lead-kun! I got 
the Seed of Beginnings!

00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:00.280
What about you, Lead-kun? 
Did you find the vase?

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:03.540
I did find the Vase of Endings.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:04.910
And...

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:08.080
She stole it from me!

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:09.560
Huh?!

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:13.220
Nee-san was so mean!

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:15.310
Nee-san? You mean Eliza-san?

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.940
That was... That was...

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:20.960
just too cruel!

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:24.580
N-N-N-Nee-san! What are you doing here?!

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:28.080
Lead-kun... Is that the vase?

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:32.750
<i>If I get too close, she'll charm me, 
and it'll all be over!</i>

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:36.670
<i>I sorta want that to happen, 
but I'll protect this vase with my life!</i>

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:40.090
I-I won't let you have it this time, 
even if you say you love me!

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:45.600
I'm sorry.

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:50.540
I thought about some things 
after we last met.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:54.500
After telling you that I loved you, 
I took everything you had collected

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:56.640
and that was awful of me.

00:04:57.720 --> 00:05:01.890
I was wrong when I said 
I loved you like everyone else.

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:05.020
Nee...

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:09.610
Lead-kun, I...

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:12.110
don't actually love you that much!

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:14.370
Huh?

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:17.630
I mean, you're not that strong!

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:20.390
You're aloof and gaudy!

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:22.880
And you're smaller than me!

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.880
KO.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:30.340
And I'm always trying to stand with 
my tail so no one can tell my height!

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:31.890
And...

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:35.130
You're always looking at me 
in a perverted way, aren't you?

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:37.640
I'm... not!

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:41.300
No way! You've been 
ogling me this whole time.

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:45.440
I don't like gentlemen like that.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:46.590
Actually...

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:48.520
I hate them.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:54.280
A girl told me that she hates me...

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:57.200
No man could survive that!

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:00.400
And when I woke up...

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:02.730
She had taken the vase from me!

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:07.130
It's not fair! It's just too cruel!

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:12.020
That wasn't... the usual Nee-san!

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:12.020
You're right...

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:15.380
You know, that might've been an illusion.

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:20.470
I was shown something awful 
while I was underground, too.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:24.030
Wait, so that Nee-san...

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:28.280
I thought some plant or monster 
could be behind all this,

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:31.370
but if they took the vase, it must be...

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:33.540
a student's magic.

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:42.800
Wow, he was a total pushover, Orobas-sama.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:47.140
It was an insta-kill! And he had 
no idea it was your magic.

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:50.170
I don't know what kind of illusion he saw,

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:53.170
but now they have zero points.

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:57.420
But to think the other one 
made it back to the surface...

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:59.680
Yes, indeed. The nerve!

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:00.990
Iruma...

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:07.240
Anyway, let's meet up 
with Eliza-san and confirm!

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:09.070
Y-You're right!

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:12.550
<i>There's no way Nee-san would hate me!</i>

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:15.320
<i>It had to be an illusion... I think!</i>

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:16.830
All right.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:19.830
Now that that's settled, leave this to me.

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:24.020
What's all this?

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:25.280
Your training!

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:28.750
Apparently, your concentration 
goes up when you feel cornered.

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:31.050
So let's have you multitask!

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:33.120
A book in your right hand!

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:34.960
A video game in your left!

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:36.720
Music playing in your ears!

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:40.230
While you're concentrating on all those, 
steal away my five senses!

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:49.110
<b>Controller</b>

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:49.110
<b>Sensory Bandit</b>

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:46.390
<i>The range of Lead's bloodline 
ability, Controller,</i>

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:49.110
<i>can change depending on his 
mana and concentration.</i>

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:51.600
This is killing me!

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:54.240
I'm sure you won't get used to 
it immediately, but it's okay!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.400
I'll be right next to you, cheering you on!

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:58.360
<i>Shut up! This is hell!</i>

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:02.620
<i>"Ten Secrets to Becoming Popular with Girls!"</i>

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:06.210
<i>If my concentration breaks even a little...</i>

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.840
<i>I'll miss out on some information.</i>

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:11.760
<i>This is so intense!</i>

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:16.750
<i>But because of all this, 
my concentration is automatically maxed!</i>

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:20.040
<i>I'm so worked up right now!</i>

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:22.320
<i>Come on, pick it up!</i>

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:23.390
Ugh, I'm beat.

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:24.480
Whoa, a magical beast!

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:24.000
<i>Find information on Nee-san!</i>

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:27.040
I still only have 250 points!

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:28.840
Elizabetta...

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:31.380
took my points!

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:32.480
Where's Lead? Find Lead!

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:33.920
They got me!

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:36.330
That's totally cheating!

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:40.910
<i>There!</i>

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.460
<i>Okay! Where is she? 
I'll locate her by what they're saying!</i>

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.170
So soft!

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.530
Your skin's so smooth, Nee-san!

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:55.920
So is yours, Clara-chan.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:58.920
<i>Wait, is this...</i>

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:00.680
<i>Could it be?!</i>

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:04.250
This is paradise!

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:06.680
The bath feels so nice!

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:11.770
<i>Is this on the devil?!</i>

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.190
<b>On the</b>

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.190
<b>On the</b>

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.190
<b>Devil</b>

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.190
<b>Devil</b>

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:14.520
Lead-kun?! Are you okay?!

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:15.940
Wait, shh!

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:17.950
Tsk, tsk, tsk.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.690
I can feel all my exhaustion melting away.

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:25.580
This really is paradise!

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:28.050
Since we keep getting dirty
during the Harvest Festival,

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:30.580
aren't these hot springs lovely?

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:32.830
Are you enjoying yourselves?

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:34.590
Very much!

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:38.690
I never thought I'd be able to enjoy 
a bath out here in the wilderness.

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:41.520
This side's warm! This side's hot!

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:49.100
This side's warm! This side's hot!

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:46.160
I must say, it's a bit exhilarating 
 doing this right out in the open.

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:49.100
Don't worry. We're the only ones here.

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:52.520
I have my magical beasts 
standing guard over my kingdom.

00:09:50.470 --> 00:09:53.360
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:56.740
We can talk here without anyone hearing us.

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:00.320
<i>I'm definitely hearing you!</i>

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:04.920
<i>I never thought trying to scout Nee-san's 
location would lead to such a lucky—</i>

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:07.210
<i>I had no idea she'd be so unguarded!</i>

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:08.870
Controller
<b>Sensory Bandit</b>

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:08.870
m 0 0 l 250 0 250 90 0 90

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:13.150
<i>But to think Nee-san and Clara 
 met up with Queen Keroli...</i>

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:16.130
But you know...

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:18.480
It's still very apparent that...

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:20.030
you have an amazing figure.

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:21.850
Why, thank you.

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:25.200
But Clara-chan's not so bad herself.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:27.390
Nee-san's so soft...

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:29.460
O-Oh, really?

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:31.800
Well... I'm still growing, so...

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:34.080
Kerolin, your skin's so smooth!

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:36.650
No fair! I want to touch, too.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:39.720
Kerolin's skin is cold and bouncy!

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:40.660
You're right!

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:42.220
Hey, wait!

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:43.440
L-Lead-kun?

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:48.080
I'm so happy I was born with this power!

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:48.080
Y-You're crying?!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.700
A-Are you okay?!

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:51.700
Yeah, now shut up.

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:53.230
So soft.

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:54.260
H-Hey...

00:10:54.260 --> 00:10:56.710
Okay, now let's get down to business.

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:59.760
You went to the trouble of sending 
one of your magical beasts

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:03.050
to invite us to these lovely hot springs.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:07.840
Is it safe to assume that you 
want to work with us, Kero-chan?

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:09.360
Yes.

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:12.030
Since I invited you to these hot springs...

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:14.850
In return, I'd like you both 
to participate in our plan.

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:19.230
<i>Plan?! So they </i>are<i> after someone?</i>

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:21.360
<i>I can't miss out on this!</i>

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:23.620
<i>But there's just one problem.</i>

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:26.240
<i>All I'm hearing is their voices.</i>

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:29.430
<i>I'm almost completely sure this is 
Nee-san and the other girls talking.</i>

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:33.690
<i>But if I can't see them, 
I can't be completely sure it's them.</i>

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:35.250
<i>Which means...</i>

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:38.900
<i>I guess I'll just have to 
take their sight, too.</i>

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:40.450
<i>Oh, I have no ill intentions.</i>

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:43.930
<i>This process is necessary 
to obtain this information.</i>

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.440
<i>Which means...</i>

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:48.560
<i>I have a damn good excuse 
now! Let's go, Lead!</i>

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.650
<i>Time to climb the stairs to adulthood!</i>

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:51.440
But...

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:54.340
I'm a bit worried that 
someone might be watching us.

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:56.080
I feel an uncomfortable presence.

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:56.940
Eek!

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.940
Oh, no! Someone's watching us?

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:02.080
Would someone actually 
do something so perverted?

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:03.820
<b>Perverted</b>

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:05.120
<i>Perverted... Perverted...</i>

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:07.360
Pervert.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:09.760
I'm not a pervert, dang it!

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:11.530
L-Lead-kun?!

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:13.730
Oh, crap! I cut off my powers!

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:14.790
Huh? Wait, what?

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:17.880
But I know where Nee-san is, which means...

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.970
I'm going to go see her 
in person, fair and square!

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:21.850
Oh, wait.

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:24.560
I mean, I'm going to go confirm 
if Nee-san has the vase or not!

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:26.190
Huh? U-Uh, sure.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:32.050
Wait, hold up! Who the heck is that?! What?!

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:34.680
Um, Naphula-san is, uh...

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:38.320
They stink! Wait, they stink! 
What's going on?! Wait, they sti—

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:38.320
Um, uh, um...

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:42.030
Welcome back...

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.690
I see that you're wearing clothes...

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:46.690
We'd be weirdos if we weren't.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:48.570
You smell freshly bathed!

00:12:48.570 --> 00:12:51.880
I'm so glad to be alive in this moment!

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:53.630
Well, let's get going.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:56.720
Now, hold on a millet!

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:58.560
Yogurt-a just go!

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:00.340
No holding back!

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:05.500
I'd like you two to charm our 
enemies so we can score high points.

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:07.120
Badump, badump, badump... 
Badump, badump, badump, badump...

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:07.360
Of course, we'll split our earnings evenly.

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:08.460
Enemies?

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:11.040
Oh, are we going to go 
after the Legend Leaf?

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:12.220
No.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:16.290
<i>Nothing uncertain is going 
to make my heart quiver.</i>

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:18.560
<i>The Legend Leaf?</i>

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.280
<i>I'm far more excited</i>

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:24.840
<i>thinking about all the 
points amassed over there.</i>

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:33.600
<i>An exquisite location much closer that'll 
guarantee us a mountain of points to steal.</i>

00:13:34.340 --> 00:13:37.480
Let's go ahead and take that castle.

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:49.760
I come with a message!

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:52.450
Pipe down! You're in 
the presence of our lord!

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:54.390
We're being attacked! Numbers unknown!

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:55.100
What?

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:55.890
Mm?

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:02.440
Fight! Advance!

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:04.850
Take the castle!

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:07.610
Take it for Queen Keroli!

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:13.490
They're trying to get into the castle!

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:14.840
Stop them!

00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:16.120
Protect the gates!

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:18.620
I come with a message, my lord!

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:21.590
The magical beasts are formidable opponents!

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:24.380
We currently have five injured, 
and two have forfeited!

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:26.420
Some finally forfeited...

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:29.880
Curse those magical beasts... 
There's no end to them!

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:32.160
Damn you, Crocell...

00:14:33.190 --> 00:14:36.410
"Warning. You'd best hand 
over your points and castle,

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:39.190
or else we will destroy your castle 
and everything with it.

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:42.570
The Queen of the Magical 
Beasts Kingdom, Crocell Keroli."

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:44.740
Warning, my ass!

00:14:44.740 --> 00:14:49.240
The Magical Beasts Kingdom is demanding
 we hand over our points and our castle.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:50.280
Hmph.

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:53.240
They've got good taste, 
coming after this castle.

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:56.520
They said we'd be unharmed 
if we obey, but...

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:00.360
We're not going to give in!

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:06.650
We all joined forces and 
created this space together!

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:08.000
This is our home!

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:09.890
You all feel the same way, don't you?

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:13.600
We were invited in right when we 
were all going to give up and forfeit.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:17.680
This is our precious home filled with 
so many wonderful memories!

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:25.810
There's no way we could just hand it over!

00:15:34.820 --> 00:15:35.890
Yes!

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:39.700
That's right! Let's chase off 
the magical beasts together!

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:42.710
We'll fight to the very last!

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:45.200
Yeah!

00:15:45.550 --> 00:15:47.010
Everyone...

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:50.610
Let's protect it! Let's protect our castle!

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:51.200
Yeah!

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:51.890
Yes.

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:52.490
Yeah!

00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:53.210
Yeah!

00:15:53.210 --> 00:15:54.960
Yeah!

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:59.350
I'm the one who made this castle! 
It doesn't belong to any of you!

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:02.640
What are you jerks getting all riled up for?

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:05.230
Well, they're all very determined.

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:10.920
I already told them to just take 
the points in this castle and leave.

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:12.040
Not a chance.

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:15.990
Because we love this place.

00:16:19.050 --> 00:16:22.240
Everyone likes this castle.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:26.970
Not to mention, you were planning 
to use yourself and this castle as decoys

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:29.620
and let everyone flee, 
weren't you, Agares-dono?

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.880
Everyone's caught on already.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:38.390
We're all together until 
the Harvest Festival ends.

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:40.880
Seriously...

00:16:41.740 --> 00:16:44.230
You guys are so weird.

00:16:49.630 --> 00:16:53.650
Hand over! The castle! To our queen!

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:55.350
Don't let them through!

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:59.160
We're going to protect our home!

00:16:59.650 --> 00:17:00.660
Hmm...

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:04.170
To think they've been able to 
resist our attacks this well...

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:06.910
But we've only just begun.

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:12.170
Let's see how much longer you can 
withstand our ferocious attacks.

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:15.460
Gentleman Camui.

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:20.960
Unlike Lady Keroli, 
your talent as a summoner is low,

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.100
but you are a true gentleman.

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:26.640
There is only one way for you 
to earn that title, then,

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:30.980
and that is for you to win 
an argument against me.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:32.980
An argument?

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:37.860
You may call yourself a gentleman, 
but where were your clothes tailored?

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:39.080
Before we even talk about that,

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:42.990
you can't even stand like 
a proper gentleman.

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:45.790
Your upbringing is quite 
telling through your actions.

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:48.760
You don't even know how 
to present yourself properly?

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:49.500
H-How dare...

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:52.840
Do you have a handkerchief, a hat, a watch?

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:56.760
You reek of cheap cologne, 
and it insults my olfactory system.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:59.640
The other day at lunch, 
you used the wrong cutlery.

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:58.410
Urk... 

00:17:58.410 --> 00:18:02.540
You need to learn to fight like a gentleman.

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:01.400
How unnerving.

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:06.180
With eloquence!

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:09.680
Hear me, my brethren!

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:13.690
The inhabitants of this castle 
hunt magical beasts for points,

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:17.960
but our queen is different!

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:23.040
She loves beasts and treats us as 
noble warriors who fight alongside her!

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:27.030
Let us return her kindness 
and deep love with gratitude!

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:30.120
Those who have a strong 
command over words...

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:33.050
...have command over others.

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:38.050
Let us present this castle 
to our beautiful queen!

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:44.440
For our queen! For our queen!

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:47.320
They're even more aggressive?!

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:53.070
Oh, no! They broke through—

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.230
Winds that blow through the trees...

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:12.030
I implore you to lend me your strength!

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:18.400
You mustn't think of others as objects just

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:21.310
because you can control 
them with your powers.

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:26.150
Even if they do not reply, 
if you talk to them...

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:29.100
They'll answer you with their actions!

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:32.110
Make sure you get along 
with your wind friends.

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:33.280
Yes, ma'am!

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:36.460
I'm very skilled in having 
one-sided conversations!

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:41.260
And now for my new technique...

00:19:49.280 --> 00:19:50.790
Wind-Sword Save!

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:54.290
<b>Wind-Sword Save</b>

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:00.920
I thank you for your assistance.

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:04.690
Just the beasts...

00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:06.430
...were blown away?!

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:09.310
Hmm... Not bad,

00:20:09.620 --> 00:20:11.560
Gar...p?!

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:13.420
Thank you for saving us!

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:15.680
That was amazing! How did you do that?

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:17.520
That was so cool!

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:19.560
Well, you've definitely 
got my attention now.

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:21.850
You can tell me all about 
your new technique later...

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:25.080
When we're all alone.

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:26.900
Y-You're too close!

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:30.340
Sir Camui! He's flirting with those girls!

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:31.460
He's flirting!

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:35.550
Hey, calm down! We have our queen!

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:37.800
Isn't that right, Sir Camui?

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:40.720
Yes, you are correct.

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:43.090
But that's that!

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:45.790
Frolicking with ladies in my 
presence is unacceptable!

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:47.440
They shall be punished with death!

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:52.560
Come forth, our most 
powerful reinforcements!

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:08.440
Those are boss-class magical beasts!

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:14.200
Now it's an all-out war!

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:17.960
We will give this castle to Queen Keroli.

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:20.960
You will not take a step further!

00:21:24.430 --> 00:21:25.720
Yes!

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:28.230
Take that whole castle for me!

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:31.760
Then I will become the Young King!

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:33.220
Oh, my...

00:21:36.610 --> 00:21:38.230
Wind-Sword Save!

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:41.800
Wha?

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:43.730
What the heck is this?

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:48.810
All forces, advance!

00:21:50.430 --> 00:21:52.430
Let us go forth!

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:58.220
Trample them!

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:33.250
Chuu churu pura poppe!

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:34.180
<b>Su</b>

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:34.180
<b>Ki</b>

00:23:32.510 --> 00:23:34.180
<b>Ma</b>

00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:38.770
Hey, hey, when we get out of the bath, 
let's play Pinpokoporoncho!

00:23:38.770 --> 00:23:40.720
Th-That sounds like a great idea.

00:23:41.090 --> 00:23:43.260
<i>Pinpokoporoncho?</i>

00:23:43.260 --> 00:23:44.980
O-Of course...

00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:47.520
<i>Pinpokoporoncho?</i>

00:23:47.710 --> 00:23:50.190
<i>Pinpokoporoncho...</i>

00:23:47.780 --> 00:23:50.190
<b>Pinpokoporoncho</b>

00:23:47.780 --> 00:23:50.190
<b>Pinpokoporoncho</b>

00:23:50.370 --> 00:23:53.120
Oh, I know. It must be this.

00:23:53.590 --> 00:23:55.990
No, it's this!

00:23:56.200 --> 00:23:57.420
Non, non!

00:23:57.760 --> 00:24:03.000
Pinpokoporoncho!

00:24:00.230 --> 00:24:02.240
Fire dancing?!

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:27.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:24:03.800 --> 00:24:06.910
Yes, I am Queen Crocell Keroli.

00:24:06.910 --> 00:24:10.170
There is one other way 
to properly address me.

00:24:10.170 --> 00:24:12.630
The title bestowed upon the 
winner of the Harvest Festival,

00:24:12.630 --> 00:24:14.050
yes, the Young King!

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:16.470
The Young King has a high chance 
of becoming the next Demon King.

00:24:17.480 --> 00:24:19.480
That's wonderful. A queen <i>and</i> a king.

00:24:19.480 --> 00:24:21.260
And a dem-dol in secret!

00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:25.060
Next time on <i>Welcome to Demon School! 
Iruma-kun</i>, "The True Worth of the Archer."

00:24:25.320 --> 00:24:27.980
Gather in the name of Crocell Keroli!
